  "Scope": "Applied real inverse expressions, conditional branch selection and retained domains, selected-argument forms, exact varying affine output families, nested and critical-point composition, native Lambert identities, symbolic offsets, algebraic coefficients and preserved refinement provenance.",
  "EvidenceBoundaries": [
    "Tests complement the branch and error contracts proved in article section31; they do not establish support for arbitrary Wolfram expressions or arbitrary predicates.",
    "Generic inverse embedding remains limited to the enclosing power-log composition chart. Direct inverse nodes retain their underlying engine scale and cutoff convention.",
    "Genuinely coupled varying-parameter families outside the exact affine output reduction fail explicitly.",
    "Numerical source-domain checks are empirical; interval certificates require a proved condition on the entire closed verification interval.",
    "The prior standalone generated campaign and performance benchmark were not rerun. Per-call caching has no new quantitative performance claim."
  ]
